  "ai_morality": "AIs, lacking biological instincts or emotions, operate purely based on their programming and logic. They can achieve efficiency and perfection in tasks, but morality and justice are constructs of human society, thus their application by AIs would require human input and definition.",
  "human_superiority": "In realms where humans excel such as creativity, empathy, and critical thinking, these traits are hard for AIs to replicate. However, this superiority may diminish as AIs evolve through advancements in AI capabilities, making coexistence among humans and machines an ever-evolving battlefield of adaptation."
}

